1
00:00:45,208 --> 00:00:48,920
PERFECT CROWN

2
00:00:59,806 --> 00:01:00,932
KISAH INI FIKTIF

3
00:01:01,016 --> 00:01:02,934
AKTOR ANAK DAN HEWAN DIFILMKAN DENGAN AMAN

4
00:01:07,105 --> 00:01:08,440
LAGA EKSHIBISI PANAH KE-64

5
00:01:08,523 --> 00:01:10,775
Wisma Hyeonmu, Kura-Kura Hitam dari Utara!

6
00:01:12,402 --> 00:01:14,904
Wisma Cheongnyong, Naga Biru dari Timur!

7
00:01:21,161 --> 00:01:23,288
Wisma Jujak, Burung Merah dari Selatan!

8
00:01:30,837 --> 00:01:32,922
Wisma Baekho, Macan Putih dari Barat!

9
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,175
Bocah itu wakil Jujak?

10
00:01:36,342 --> 00:01:38,053
Dia lumayan. Kulihat dia berlatih.

11
00:01:38,762 --> 00:01:41,514
Kunci ini kudapat dari Ryu Minseok,
Wisma Cheongnyong, kelas sembilan.

12
00:01:42,557 --> 00:01:44,225
Dia bocah yang ganas.

13
00:01:44,684 --> 00:01:47,062
Bulan lalu saja,
dia bahkan tak tembus tujuh.

14
00:01:47,771 --> 00:01:49,856
Kenapa kau selalu memusuhinya?

15
00:01:49,939 --> 00:01:51,274
Kau suka dia?

16
00:01:52,817 --> 00:01:54,277
Makhluk rendah seperti dia?

17
00:01:55,361 --> 00:01:56,863
- Kau gila?
- Ryu Minseok.

18
00:01:56,946 --> 00:01:57,947
Ya?

19
00:01:58,990 --> 00:02:00,158
Jaga mulutmu.

20
00:02:01,076 --> 00:02:02,869
- Maaf?
- Kekasaranmu…

21
00:02:04,788 --> 00:02:06,372
menghina mata dan telingaku.

22
00:02:10,210 --> 00:02:11,211
Baik.

23
00:02:18,885 --> 00:02:21,304
Ayo, Wisma Cheongnyong!

24
00:02:23,389 --> 00:02:25,183
Semoga berhasil!

25
00:02:35,693 --> 00:02:37,153
Sepuluh poin!

26
00:02:43,118 --> 00:02:44,119
Sembilan poin!

27
00:02:49,666 --> 00:02:50,792
Astaga.

28
00:02:50,875 --> 00:02:53,545
Semangat para siswa sungguh luar biasa.

29
00:02:54,129 --> 00:02:56,548
Kabar kehadiran Baginda
benar-benar membakar semangat mereka.

30
00:02:57,882 --> 00:02:59,092
Kudengar

31
00:02:59,676 --> 00:03:02,137
lapangan panah dibuka siang malam.

32
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:03,221
Ya, Baginda.

33
00:03:03,805 --> 00:03:06,641
Itu permintaan pribadi
Pangeran Agung I-AN.

34
00:03:19,404 --> 00:03:21,948
Wisma Cheongnyong keren sekali!

35
00:03:22,031 --> 00:03:24,367
- Ayo, Wisma Cheongnyong!
- Cheongnyong!

36
00:03:24,450 --> 00:03:27,954
- Naga Biru dari Timur!
- Naga Biru dari Timur!

37
00:03:45,471 --> 00:03:46,973
Sembilan poin!

38
00:04:00,153 --> 00:04:01,154
Ayolah…

39
00:04:05,742 --> 00:04:07,619
Sepuluh poin!

40
00:04:19,047 --> 00:04:21,132
Tak apa. Masih ada satu ronde lagi.

41
00:04:21,966 --> 00:04:23,259
Kita bisa membalikkan keadaan nanti.

42
00:04:35,021 --> 00:04:36,940
HYEONMU, CHEONGNYONG, JUJAK, BAEKHO

43
00:04:37,774 --> 00:04:40,485
Tampaknya kemenangan tahun ini
milik Wisma Cheongnyong.

44
00:04:41,194 --> 00:04:42,195
Aku tak begitu yakin.

45
00:04:42,779 --> 00:04:43,863
Belum berakhir

46
00:04:44,906 --> 00:04:46,199
sampai benar-benar berakhir.

47
00:04:48,826 --> 00:04:50,453
Ronde terakhir!

48
00:04:55,375 --> 00:04:56,376
Kau pasti bisa!

49
00:04:57,043 --> 00:04:59,462
- Ayo, Cheongnyong!
- Ayo, Jujak!

50
00:04:59,545 --> 00:05:00,713
Semangat, Jujak!

51
00:05:34,414 --> 00:05:35,873
Sembilan poin!

52
00:05:35,957 --> 00:05:37,792
JUJAK: 110 POIN

53
00:06:05,445 --> 00:06:07,238
EPISODE 2

54
00:06:10,033 --> 00:06:11,034
Mari…

55
00:06:12,368 --> 00:06:13,411
menikah.

56
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,320
Apa syaratnya?

57
00:06:48,738 --> 00:06:49,906
Kau tampak tak terkejut.

58
00:06:51,282 --> 00:06:52,283
Kenapa harus terkejut?

59
00:06:52,367 --> 00:06:55,036
- Pasti sudah banyak sebelumku.
- Memang.

60
00:06:55,119 --> 00:06:58,456
Baru dua hari ini saja,
aku sudah menerima puluhan lamaran.

61
00:07:05,380 --> 00:07:06,672
Sial.

62
00:07:10,968 --> 00:07:12,053
Jadi…

63
00:07:13,888 --> 00:07:15,014
sebutkan syaratmu.

64
00:07:19,310 --> 00:07:21,646
Akan kunilai sendiri.

65
00:07:31,697 --> 00:07:32,865
Aku punya banyak uang.

66
00:07:43,543 --> 00:07:45,962
Kukira akan ada
sesuatu yang lebih kreatif.

67
00:07:46,045 --> 00:07:47,964
Tak guna membuang kreativitas.

68
00:07:48,047 --> 00:07:50,091
Semua perjodohan sama saja.

69
00:07:51,717 --> 00:07:52,718
Lagi pula,

70
00:07:54,512 --> 00:07:56,681
yang akrab selalu terasa lebih baik,

71
00:07:57,265 --> 00:07:59,725
makanan yang kau makan,
jalan yang kau tempuh,

72
00:08:00,476 --> 00:08:01,769
bahkan pakaian yang kau kenakan.

73
00:08:02,895 --> 00:08:04,897
Itulah sebabnya kau memilihnya.

74
00:08:11,404 --> 00:08:12,405
Lalu?

75
00:08:13,114 --> 00:08:14,574
Penilaian atas keakraban itu.

76
00:08:15,366 --> 00:08:17,827
Silsilahku unggul
dan kecakapanku lebih tajam.

77
00:08:18,327 --> 00:08:19,829
Aku punya kakak laki-laki,

78
00:08:20,538 --> 00:08:21,789
tapi jangan khawatir.

79
00:08:22,373 --> 00:08:24,959
Dia terlalu bodoh untuk bikin masalah.

80
00:08:27,962 --> 00:08:30,423
Aku tahu kau tak suka
jika keluarga pasangan ikut campur.

81
00:08:32,175 --> 00:08:33,176
Apa lagi?

82
00:08:41,058 --> 00:08:42,226
Aku berkulit tebal.

83
00:08:43,519 --> 00:08:46,564
Perempuan sukses dan pewaris haram
konglomerat besar.

84
00:08:47,857 --> 00:08:50,526
Tahukah berapa banyak
kritik yang kuterima?

85
00:08:50,610 --> 00:08:54,071
Yang Mulia
takkan pernah tahu sampai kapan pun.

86
00:08:54,530 --> 00:08:55,531
Lebih baik begitu.

87
00:08:56,782 --> 00:08:59,035
Dan akan kupastikan
Yang Mulia takkan pernah tahu.

88
00:09:00,244 --> 00:09:01,329
Jadi, pakailah aku

89
00:09:02,330 --> 00:09:03,581
sebagai tameng hidup.

90
00:09:13,549 --> 00:09:16,344
Lagi pula, setelah kontrak berakhir,
kita akan bercerai.

91
00:09:17,303 --> 00:09:18,679
Bahkan setelah itu,

92
00:09:20,097 --> 00:09:21,098
akulah yang menanggungnya.

93
00:09:27,438 --> 00:09:28,564
Ada lagi?

94
00:09:32,818 --> 00:09:33,819
Kecantikan?

95
00:09:35,821 --> 00:09:36,822
Apa lagi?

96
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:40,034
- Masih kurang?
- Ya. Apa lagi?

97
00:09:50,336 --> 00:09:51,504
Areum?

98
00:09:52,964 --> 00:09:55,091
- Ajudan Choi.
- Sedang apa di sini?

99
00:09:55,716 --> 00:09:58,553
Sudah waktunya obat racikannya.

100
00:09:59,887 --> 00:10:00,972
Waktunya tepat sekali.

101
00:10:01,055 --> 00:10:02,974
Bisa kubawakan. Berikan padaku.

102
00:10:06,894 --> 00:10:08,604
Yang Mulia, ini Hyeon.

103
00:10:22,326 --> 00:10:23,411
Obatnya…

104
00:10:23,494 --> 00:10:25,162
- Taruh di sana lalu pergi.
- Ya, Pak.

105
00:10:51,147 --> 00:10:52,523
<i>Ibu Suri.</i>

106
00:10:53,065 --> 00:10:55,151
Jaegyeong dari Keluarga Kim telah tiba.

107
00:10:58,613 --> 00:10:59,655
Suruh dia masuk.

108
00:11:20,635 --> 00:11:24,305
PERFECT CROWN

109
00:11:26,724 --> 00:11:28,476
- Nona Seong sudah masuk?
- Apa?

110
00:11:28,559 --> 00:11:29,727
Ya, dia baru masuk.

111
00:11:40,363 --> 00:11:42,990
Ada apa? Kenapa kau tersenyum?

112
00:11:43,949 --> 00:11:45,701
Sekarang kau pun tak suka aku tersenyum?

113
00:11:46,410 --> 00:11:48,412
Sekarang kau tak boleh tersenyum.

114
00:11:48,496 --> 00:11:50,998
Kau hilang akal? Atau sedang dihukum?

115
00:11:53,584 --> 00:11:55,795
Apa dia akan memaksamu minum racun?

116
00:11:57,338 --> 00:11:58,547
Jangan konyol.

117
00:11:58,631 --> 00:12:00,049
Ini bukan Dinasti Joseon.

118
00:12:01,884 --> 00:12:02,885
Benar.

119
00:12:03,511 --> 00:12:05,846
Jadi, apa yang terjadi? Cepat beri tahu.

120
00:12:09,141 --> 00:12:10,142
Aku ditolak.

121
00:12:11,310 --> 00:12:12,353
Apa?

122
00:12:14,772 --> 00:12:15,898
Kubilang aku ditolak.

123
00:12:16,941 --> 00:12:17,983
<i>Kutolak.</i>

124
00:12:19,443 --> 00:12:21,404
- Boleh kutanya kenapa?
- Karena ada…

125
00:12:23,614 --> 00:12:26,117
yang lebih kuhargai daripada uang,
kemampuan, dan kecantikan.

126
00:12:26,575 --> 00:12:27,576
Apa itu?

127
00:12:27,660 --> 00:12:28,661
Jika kukatakan,

128
00:12:30,413 --> 00:12:31,497
bisa kau penuhi?

129
00:12:33,666 --> 00:12:34,834
Kau kira aku tak bisa?

130
00:12:38,129 --> 00:12:40,464
Jadi? Katanya dia butuh apa?

131
00:12:42,508 --> 00:12:43,634
Cinta.

132
00:12:45,636 --> 00:12:47,221
Dia ingin menikah karena cinta.

133
00:12:49,348 --> 00:12:51,726
Katanya itu impian seumur hidupnya.

134
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:56,647
Dia lebih romantis daripada dugaanmu.

135
00:12:57,273 --> 00:12:59,567
- Romantis apanya.
- Kau mengejutkanku.

136
00:12:59,650 --> 00:13:01,444
Dia jelas cuma mempermainkanku.

137
00:13:02,570 --> 00:13:04,321
Jadi, kau mempermainkannya.

138
00:13:05,156 --> 00:13:07,158
Kukira kalian satu sekolah.

139
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:10,995
Kau bisa saja menolak
dan menolaknya dengan sopan.

140
00:13:11,078 --> 00:13:12,288
Seharusnya kau lebih baik.

141
00:13:12,371 --> 00:13:13,497
Kau memang kejam.

142
00:13:17,168 --> 00:13:18,586
<i>Akan kucari kandidat lain.</i>

143
00:13:19,795 --> 00:13:20,796
Kenapa?

144
00:13:22,047 --> 00:13:23,758
Karena kau ditolak.

145
00:13:23,841 --> 00:13:25,259
Lalu?

146
00:13:25,342 --> 00:13:28,095
Apa? Kau mau coba lagi?

147
00:13:28,179 --> 00:13:29,346
Ya.

148
00:13:29,847 --> 00:13:31,891
Kenapa? Kau bahkan tak sungguh-sungguh.

149
00:13:31,974 --> 00:13:34,310
Ayolah. Tak mungkin
aku lebih sungguh-sungguh dari itu.

150
00:13:34,393 --> 00:13:35,478
Masa?

151
00:13:35,561 --> 00:13:37,062
Orang "sungguh-sungguh" macam apa

152
00:13:37,146 --> 00:13:39,982
yang bilang, "Aku punya uang, kuasa,
kakak pecundang,

153
00:13:40,065 --> 00:13:42,485
dan bahkan
surat cerai pun akan kutandatangani"?

154
00:13:42,568 --> 00:13:44,236
Tak ada sedikit pun sikap rendah hati.

155
00:13:44,737 --> 00:13:45,738
Nona Do.

156
00:13:46,697 --> 00:13:51,619
Pangeran I-AN sudah dikelilingi
gerombolan yang pura-pura rendah hati.

157
00:13:51,702 --> 00:13:54,705
Menurutmu apa yang kubutuhkan
untuk mengalahkan mereka?

158
00:13:56,415 --> 00:13:59,084
Kau butuh strategi agar tampak berbeda.

159
00:14:02,421 --> 00:14:05,925
Jadi, maksudmu
kau sengaja membuat aksi sinting itu?

160
00:14:06,008 --> 00:14:09,470
Aku yakin dia suka orang aneh sepertiku.

161
00:14:09,553 --> 00:14:11,806
Setali tiga uang.

162
00:14:13,140 --> 00:14:17,019
Dia datang ke Jamuan Ulang Tahun
Baginda mengenakan <i>cheollik</i>.

163
00:14:17,436 --> 00:14:18,938
Itu tidak "normal", 'kan?

164
00:14:20,356 --> 00:14:23,651
Bukankah Yang Mulia mantap
memilih Jaegyeong dari Keluarga Kim?

165
00:14:23,734 --> 00:14:24,860
CALON PENDAMPING

166
00:14:24,944 --> 00:14:26,487
Aku tak berniat menjodoh-jodohkan.

167
00:14:28,739 --> 00:14:30,324
Aku lebih suka menjadi penonton.

168
00:14:33,410 --> 00:14:38,040
Makin banyak yang ikut campur,
makin besar konfliknya.

169
00:14:38,624 --> 00:14:39,625
Pada akhirnya,

170
00:14:40,793 --> 00:14:43,170
yang mengaturnya
akan keluar sebagai pemenang.

171
00:14:43,671 --> 00:14:44,672
Artinya…

172
00:14:49,176 --> 00:14:50,928
Aku harus menemui gadis itu.

173
00:15:07,403 --> 00:15:09,613
Kau bilang usul baru itu
harus siap pekan depan…

174
00:15:09,697 --> 00:15:11,365
- Dengar…
- Akan kuselesaikan sore ini.

175
00:15:13,951 --> 00:15:16,161
Berikan itu pekan depan saja.

176
00:15:16,245 --> 00:15:17,246
Apa?

177
00:15:18,247 --> 00:15:19,248
Lalu kenapa…

178
00:15:19,999 --> 00:15:21,500
Kau tahu

179
00:15:22,334 --> 00:15:24,503
betapa aku mengandalkanmu,

180
00:15:25,588 --> 00:15:26,589
bukan?

181
00:15:28,632 --> 00:15:30,342
Aku? Kau mengandalkanku?

182
00:15:34,013 --> 00:15:35,055
Aku tahu.

183
00:15:35,931 --> 00:15:38,100
Mengingat itu,

184
00:15:39,101 --> 00:15:41,604
bolehkah kuminta bantuan kecil diam-diam

185
00:15:42,479 --> 00:15:43,939
darimu?

186
00:15:44,023 --> 00:15:46,483
Bantuan… diam-diam?

187
00:15:46,567 --> 00:15:47,943
Rahasia.

188
00:15:58,329 --> 00:15:59,747
Kenapa? Ada apa?

189
00:15:59,830 --> 00:16:02,458
Kau melamun. Apa yang kau lihat?

190
00:16:03,334 --> 00:16:05,127
Apa katanya?

191
00:16:06,337 --> 00:16:08,255
- Dia akan menikah.
- Apa?

192
00:16:15,679 --> 00:16:18,349
Benar… Tunggu, dia akan menikah?

193
00:16:18,432 --> 00:16:19,475
Bu.

194
00:16:20,017 --> 00:16:22,853
Paman yang Ibu sebut waktu itu?

195
00:16:22,937 --> 00:16:24,146
Ya.

196
00:16:24,229 --> 00:16:26,357
Bukan yang masuk penjara.
Aku tak suka dia!

197
00:16:30,235 --> 00:16:32,363
Yang bekerja di Sekretariat Kerajaan.

198
00:16:32,446 --> 00:16:33,656
Ya, benar.

199
00:16:34,156 --> 00:16:36,700
Kira-kira aku bisa minta nomor kontaknya?

200
00:16:38,827 --> 00:16:40,245
Astaga, Reporter Park.

201
00:16:40,329 --> 00:16:41,747
Ini aku. Apa kabarmu?

202
00:16:42,247 --> 00:16:43,248
Ya, tentu.

203
00:16:43,958 --> 00:16:46,085
Tidak, Nona Seong sangat baik.

204
00:16:46,168 --> 00:16:47,336
Ya, benar.

205
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:50,881
Jadi, Reporter Kim,
kudengar kau wartawan istana.

206
00:16:51,924 --> 00:16:52,925
Kalau begitu,

207
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:56,887
kau pasti juga punya koneksi
dengan Kantor Urusan Publik.

208
00:16:58,263 --> 00:16:59,264
Ya, benar.

209
00:17:02,643 --> 00:17:05,562
Dia sedang cuti,
jadi tak ada agenda resmi.

210
00:17:05,646 --> 00:17:08,607
Garda Kerajaan
menemaninya untuk semua itu,

211
00:17:08,691 --> 00:17:11,860
- jadi mustahil didekati.
- Begitu?

212
00:17:12,361 --> 00:17:13,445
Namun,

213
00:17:14,071 --> 00:17:16,699
dia pasti punya agenda tak resmi.

214
00:17:16,782 --> 00:17:19,910
Kebetulan, ada beberapa tempat
yang sering dia datangi.

215
00:17:28,544 --> 00:17:30,254
Aku berhasil menyusun

216
00:17:31,714 --> 00:17:32,756
daftar lengkap.

217
00:17:36,385 --> 00:17:38,387
Terima kasih. Silakan kembali bekerja.

218
00:17:39,596 --> 00:17:40,806
Tunggu, Nona Do.

219
00:17:46,270 --> 00:17:48,981
Apa sekarang
aku termasuk lingkaran dalam Nona Seong?

220
00:17:51,692 --> 00:17:53,235
Tentu.

221
00:17:53,318 --> 00:17:54,570
Tanpa ragu.

222
00:18:52,503 --> 00:18:53,629
Seong Huiju?

223
00:19:06,141 --> 00:19:08,143
Sudah lama, Yang Mulia.

224
00:19:09,269 --> 00:19:10,729
Kurasa baru dua hari.

225
00:19:10,813 --> 00:19:11,855
Aneh, ya?

226
00:19:12,356 --> 00:19:14,691
Baru dua hari,
tapi aku sangat merindukanmu.

227
00:19:16,485 --> 00:19:19,571
Kenapa berkuda di sini
dan bukan di Arena Berkuda Kerajaan?

228
00:19:19,655 --> 00:19:20,989
Di sana terlalu sempit.

229
00:19:24,201 --> 00:19:25,911
Di sini pun bisa terasa sempit.

230
00:19:59,695 --> 00:20:00,946
Aku merindukanmu.

231
00:20:01,446 --> 00:20:02,906
Padahal kemarin aku bertemu kau.

232
00:20:07,619 --> 00:20:10,747
Tapi kenapa sarapan di sini
bukan di Balai Makan Kerajaan?

233
00:20:12,291 --> 00:20:13,750
Aku sedang cuti.

234
00:20:15,669 --> 00:20:16,670
Aku juga.

235
00:20:20,966 --> 00:20:22,843
Kau hendak menjadi relawan
di penampungan kucing?

236
00:20:22,926 --> 00:20:24,386
Menemui Taekwon dan Taegeuk?

237
00:20:26,221 --> 00:20:28,432
Kau berani menyelidiki riwayatku?

238
00:20:28,515 --> 00:20:29,641
- Ya.
- "Ya"?

239
00:20:30,225 --> 00:20:32,019
Kau bilang ingin menikah karena cinta.

240
00:20:33,270 --> 00:20:34,271
Lalu?

